{"anchor": "the texturing doesn’t look as good as their English promo counterparts.", "id": "pubq6-001", "observed_date": "2026-09-29", "post_locator": "PokeDave, opening post #1", "source_context": "The poster is considering buying favourite XY-era cards, names Shaymin ex and Yveltal ex UR from The Best Of XY, and asks owners of both whether Japanese texture differs from English promo versions and whether the apparent difference is due to the English promo release.", "source_url": "https://www.elitefourum.com/t/japanese-vs-english-xy-era/56892", "verification_method": "opened_post"}
{"anchor": "every single one of them across 5 or 6 sets, maybe more have print lines.", "id": "pubq6-002", "observed_date": "2026-09-29", "post_locator": "bk2021, opening post #1", "source_context": "The poster recently bought Japanese V and VMAX cards from several sets and sellers, many with print lines, while their English cards did not show the same issue. They ask whether these lines are common, how they fit claims of Japanese print quality, and how to judge cards otherwise described as near mint.", "source_url": "https://www.elitefourum.com/t/how-common-are-print-lines-on-japanese-cards/33544", "verification_method": "opened_post"}
{"anchor": "When looking at an ungraded card like this, what things do you specifically look for?", "id": "pubq6-003", "observed_date": "2026-09-29", "post_locator": "powerToilet, opening post #1", "source_context": "The poster links a Mercari University Magikarp listing they may buy. They ask how to evaluate an ungraded high-value card, whether it is fake, and whether avoiding ungraded expensive cards is wiser. They also wonder why the seller did not grade it.", "source_url": "https://www.elitefourum.com/t/questions-about-a-listing-and-general-buying-advice-university-magikarp-on-mercari/52314", "verification_method": "opened_post"}
{"anchor": "Today I saw a raw Snap Bulbasaur that is offered for 7.5M Yen", "id": "pubq6-004", "observed_date": "2026-09-29", "post_locator": "Mussundwerdich, opening post #1", "source_context": "The poster says a prior Snap Koffing purchase was a scam, links a current Mercari raw Snap Bulbasaur offer for 7.5 million yen, thinks it looks real, and asks other collectors what they think about the card.", "source_url": "https://www.elitefourum.com/t/snap-bulbasaur-available-on-mercari-is-it-real-or-fake/47127", "verification_method": "opened_post"}
{"anchor": "How do you guys buy things from Japan?", "id": "pubq6-005", "observed_date": "2026-09-29", "post_locator": "grumblegamer18, opening post #1", "source_context": "The poster has used the same buyer for Japanese cards and other Pokémon goods for years. They describe a 60% fee over 2,000 yen and 250 yen per cheaper item, balanced against shop visits and photo requests, then ask how others buy from Japan.", "source_url": "https://www.elitefourum.com/t/other-options-for-buying-from-japan/47064", "verification_method": "opened_post"}
{"anchor": "Just looking for a legit check from anyone in the community who happens to collect e-readers", "id": "pubq6-006", "observed_date": "2026-09-29", "post_locator": "cbobert, opening post #1", "source_context": "The poster links an eBay listing with an image for a Regidoll Japanese e-Reader+ card, says it is a grail purchase, believes it may be authentic, and asks other e-Reader collectors for a legitimacy check before a large purchase.", "source_url": "https://www.elitefourum.com/t/need-a-legit-check-on-jp-e-reader-grail-card/54643", "verification_method": "opened_post"}
{"anchor": "レックウザのmurを売る予定なのですが、初めてカードの買取をするため", "id": "pubq6-007", "observed_date": "2026-09-29", "post_locator": "nonpublic user, original question 2026-08-18", "source_context": "質問者はレックウザのMURを売る予定。メルカリはトラブルや手間が気になり秋葉原の店舗買取を検討しており、店の選び方と妥当な査定額を尋ねている。", "source_url": "https://detail.chiebukuro.yahoo.co.jp/qa/question_detail/q10330661105", "verification_method": "opened_post"}
{"anchor": "裏面の縁に数箇所、白欠け（エッジの傷）があります。", "id": "pubq6-008", "observed_date": "2026-09-29", "post_locator": "abc3ec0e0, original question 2026-05-14", "source_context": "質問者は手元の2003年ADVギフトボックスのラティアスexとラティオスexを売るかネット買取に出すか迷う。表は比較的きれいで裏面縁に白欠けがあり、需要と傷を考慮した価格、状態による価値低下を尋ねる。", "source_url": "https://detail.chiebukuro.yahoo.co.jp/qa/question_detail/q13328070453", "verification_method": "opened_post"}
{"anchor": "マスボピカチュウの現在の買取価格はどのくらいでしょうか？", "id": "pubq6-009", "observed_date": "2026-09-29", "post_locator": "1052355526, original question 2024-10-07", "source_context": "質問者はポケモンカード151のマスボピカチュウをふるいちで傷なしとして1万円と査定された。トレコロの約2万円の表示と比べて妥当か不安になり、他店の買取額も尋ねている。", "source_url": "https://detail.chiebukuro.yahoo.co.jp/qa/question_detail/q14305057554", "verification_method": "opened_post"}
{"anchor": "〖PSA10〗名探偵ピカチュウ 338 / SM-P", "id": "pubq6-010", "observed_date": "2026-09-29", "post_locator": "1150837728, original question 2026-01-08", "source_context": "質問者はオンラインオリパでPSA10の名探偵ピカチュウ338/SM-Pを当てた。初心者で相場のネット情報が異なるため、メルカリやYahooフリマで売るか店舗買取に出すか、それぞれの金額を尋ねる。", "source_url": "https://detail.chiebukuro.yahoo.co.jp/qa/question_detail/q10323959605", "verification_method": "opened_post"}
{"anchor": "このぐらいだとPSA10が取れる可能性があるのでしょうか？", "id": "pubq6-011", "observed_date": "2026-09-29", "post_locator": "cf1ddb92e, original question 2025-09-27", "source_context": "質問者は自引きしたメガリザードンXexをコレクション用にPSA鑑定へ出したい。カード表面の腹部付近に欠けか傷のようなものがあり、この状態でPSA10が取れる可能性を尋ね、現物を示す画像を参照している。", "source_url": "https://detail.chiebukuro.yahoo.co.jp/qa/question_detail/q14320459934", "verification_method": "opened_post"}
{"anchor": "カードの中に少し初期傷がある状態（もちろん記載してます）で売れました。", "id": "pubq6-012", "observed_date": "2026-09-29", "post_locator": "Rennnn, original question 2026-08-30", "source_context": "質問者は約20万円のPSA10ポケカをメルカリで販売し、購入者があんしん鑑定を選んだ。本物でQRコードからPSA10を確認できるが、説明済みの初期傷で鑑定不成立や返送になるかを尋ねる。", "source_url": "https://detail.chiebukuro.yahoo.co.jp/qa/question_detail/q13330972213", "verification_method": "opened_post"}
